# Platform: mobilesite
# Story: GJDT-22417 — 360° icon on the single-image (gallery) view, checked on the first 4 photos (AC2, AC6 gallery)
# Tags: b2b, pdp, 360, GJDT-22417
# Params : prot3_pdp_360_photos

open ${prot3_pdp_360_photos}
wait for page to load
wait until element pdp_first_photo is visible
verify element pdp_first_photo is visible
click pdp_first_photo
wait until element gallery_360_icon is visible
verify element gallery_360_icon is visible
verify element gallery_360_icon is inside gallery_slide_image
store position of gallery_360_icon in gallery_slide_image as icon_photo_1
take screenshot as gallery_photo_1
swipe left
wait 2 seconds
verify element gallery_360_icon is inside gallery_slide_image
store position of gallery_360_icon in gallery_slide_image as icon_photo_2
take screenshot as gallery_photo_2
swipe left
wait 2 seconds
verify element gallery_360_icon is inside gallery_slide_image
store position of gallery_360_icon in gallery_slide_image as icon_photo_3
take screenshot as gallery_photo_3
swipe left
wait 2 seconds
verify element gallery_360_icon is inside gallery_slide_image
store position of gallery_360_icon in gallery_slide_image as icon_photo_4
take screenshot as gallery_photo_4
